 add protection to your routine while keeping the underwear style you’re used to. <strong>A simple change underneath your usual clothes.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanImg2_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggCleanImg2_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0606/3102/3665/files/menhaven-drawer.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanImg2_alt","label":"ggCleanImg2_alt","default":"Black boxer briefs in a drawer."},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanHdr2_text","label":"ggCleanHdr2_text","default":"3. Protection Built Into Your Boxer Briefs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanBdy2_text","label":"ggCleanBdy2_text","default":"<p>The protection is <strong>part of the underwear itself</strong>, so there’s no separate pad to position inside this pair. Choose your size, put them on and change when needed. MenHaven brings the underwear and absorbent area together in <strong>one washable garment</strong> for men who prefer an integrated option.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanImg3_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggCleanImg3_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0606/3102/3665/files/menhaven-wash.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanImg3_alt","label":"ggCleanImg3_alt","default":"Folded black underwear beside a washing machine."},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanHdr3_text","label":"ggCleanHdr3_text","default":"4. Wash Them. Wear Them. Repeat."},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanBdy3_text","label":"ggCleanBdy3_text","default":"<p>A fresh pair doesn’t have to mean a disposable product. MenHaven is <strong>washable and reusable</strong>: follow the care label, let the pair dry fully, and wear it again. Keep a clean pair ready while another is in the wash. <strong>One practical routine you can repeat.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanImg4_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggCleanImg4_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0606/3102/3665/files/menhaven-outdoors-square.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanImg4_alt","label":"ggCleanImg4_alt","default":"A man enjoying a walk outdoors."},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanHdr4_text","label":"ggCleanHdr4_text","default":"5. Get On With The Rest Of Your Day"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCleanBdy4_text","label":"ggCleanBdy4_text","default":"<p>A coffee with friends. An afternoon out. Another day at work. Those last drops deserve a practical plan, but they don’t have to be the whole plan. MenHaven offers <strong>everyday backup for light leaks</strong>. Find your fit, try them at home, and take that routine into <strong>the moments that matter.</strong></p>"}],
